[{"id":"NjU-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan&nbsp;<img alt=\"n\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?n\" />&nbsp;adalah suatu bilangan bulat positif.Jumlah tiga bilangan prima 3<img alt=\"n\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?n\" />-4, 4<img alt=\"n\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?n\" />-5 dan 5<img alt=\"n\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?n\" />- 3 adalah......</p>","choices":["12","14","15","17</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI1OA"},{"id":"NjU-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui a dan b adalah dua bilang bulat positif, serta b merupkan bilangan ganjil yang lebih kecil dari pada 2017.Jika&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{a}+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Ba%7D&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{4}{b}\\doteq \\frac{1}{12}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7Bb%7D%5Cdoteq%20%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B12%7D\" />, Maka Pasangan bilangan ( a,b ) yang mungkin ada sebanyak...</p>","choices":["2","3","5","8"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI1OQ"},{"id":"NjU-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Grafik berikut mengilustrasikan lomba lari 100 m yang di ikuti oleh tiga siswa A, B dan C. Berdasarkan grafik tersebut, pernyataan yang benar adalah&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191120124717.PNG\" style=\"height:220px; width:291px\" /></p>","choices":["Pelari C selalu berlari paling depan","Pelari B disusul oleh C sebelm garis finis&nbsp;","Pelari A paling cepat berlari sampai ke garis finis&nbsp;","Pelari B memanangi lomba karena berlari dengan kecepatan Konstan."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI2MA"},{"id":"NjU-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika bilangan bulat positif x dan y merupakan solusi sistem persamaan linear&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"x+2y= p + 6\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x&amp;plus;2y%3D%20p%20&amp;plus;%206\" /></p><p><img alt=\"2x-y = 25 - 2p\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2x-y%20%3D%2025%20-%202p\" /></p><p>Maka banyak nilai p adalah.....</p>","choices":["2","3","4","5"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI2MQ"},{"id":"NjU-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui fungsi f memenuhi persamaan&nbsp;<img alt=\"5f\\left ( \\frac{1}{x} \\right )+\\frac{f\\left ( 2x \\right )}{x2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?5f%5Cleft%20%28%20%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bx%7D%20%5Cright%20%29&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7Bf%5Cleft%20%28%202x%20%5Cright%20%29%7D%7Bx2%7D\" />, Untuk X&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\neq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cneq\" />&nbsp;0. Nilai f(1) sama dengan&nbsp;</p>","choices":["&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{3}{7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B3%7D%7B7%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{3}{14 }\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B3%7D%7B14%20%7D\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{3}{18 }\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B3%7D%7B18%20%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B7%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI2Mg"},{"id":"NjU-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada jajar genjang ABCD, jarak antara sepasang sisi sejajar pertama adalah 4 cm dan jarak antara sepasang sisi sejajar lainnya adalah 9cm. Luas jajar genjang ABCD adalah .....</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191120130024.PNG\" style=\"height:99px; width:209px\" /></p>","choices":["minimal 36&nbsp;<img alt=\"cm^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?cm%5E%7B2%7D\" />","tepat 36&nbsp;<img alt=\"cm^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?cm%5E%7B2%7D\" />","maksimal 36&nbsp;<img alt=\"cm^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?cm%5E%7B2%7D\" />","anatar 36&nbsp;<img alt=\"cm^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?cm%5E%7B2%7D\" /> dan 81&nbsp;<img alt=\"cm^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?cm%5E%7B2%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI2Mw"},{"id":"NjU-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Lingkaran pada gambar berikut mempunyai radius 1 satuan panjang dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\angle DAB = 30^{\\circ }\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cangle%20DAB%20%3D%2030%5E%7B%5Ccirc%20%7D\" />. Luas Daerah trapesium ABCD yang diarsir adalah....</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191120130637.PNG\" style=\"height:154px; width:162px\" /></p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D\" />","1","<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5Csqrt%7B3%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5Csqrt%7B3%7D\" /></p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI2NA"},{"id":"NjU-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui persegi panjang ABCD dengan AB = 12 dan BC = 5 . Panjang lintasan DPQB Pada gambar berikut adalah ......</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191120131045.PNG\" style=\"height:117px; width:183px\" /></p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{119}{13}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B119%7D%7B13%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\frac{120}{13}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B120%7D%7B13%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{214}{13}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B214%7D%7B13%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{239}{13}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B239%7D%7B13%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI2NQ"},{"id":"NjU-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Di ketahui M = { 10,11,12,..,99} dan A adalah Himpunan bagian dari M yang mempunyai 4 Anggota. Jika jumlah semua anggota A merupakan suatu bilangan genap, maka banyak himpunan A yang mungkin adalah.....</p>","choices":["1980","148.995","297.990","299.970"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI2Ng"},{"id":"NjU-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dari 4 pengamatan berupa bilangan positif yang sudah diurutkan di lambangkan dengan&nbsp;<img alt=\"x_{1},x_{2},x_{3},x_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x_%7B1%7D%2Cx_%7B2%7D%2Cx_%7B3%7D%2Cx_%7B4%7D\" />.Jika jangkauan data tersebut adalah 16,&nbsp;<img alt=\"x_{1}= \\frac{1}{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x_%7B1%7D%3D%20%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B6%7D\" />&nbsp;median,&nbsp;<img alt=\"x_{2}= \\frac{1}{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x_%7B2%7D%3D%20%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;median, dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"x_{3}= x_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x_%7B3%7D%3D%20x_%7B4%7D\" />&nbsp;maka nilai rata=rata data tersebut adalah ....</p>","choices":["10","11","12&nbsp;","13"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI2Nw"},{"id":"NjU-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui N dan K adalah dua bilangan bulat. Jika terdapat tepat satu nilai k yang memenuhi pertidaksamaan&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{8}{15}&lt; \\frac{n}{n+k}&lt;\\frac{7}{13}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B8%7D%7B15%7D%3C%20%5Cfrac%7Bn%7D%7Bn&amp;plus;k%7D%3C%5Cfrac%7B7%7D%7B13%7D\" />&nbsp;maka nilai N terbesar yang mungkin Adalah....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI2OA"},{"id":"NjU-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Nilai 1 + 2.2 + 3.<img alt=\"2^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%5E%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;+ 4.<img alt=\"2^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%5E%7B2%7D\" />&nbsp;+...+ 2018.<img alt=\"2^{2017}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%5E%7B2017%7D\" />&nbsp;sama dengan.....&nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI2OQ"},{"id":"NjU-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diketahui p,q,r,s adalah bilangan - bilangan tidak nol.Bilangan r dan s adalah siolusi persamaan&nbsp;<img alt=\"x^{2}+px+q=0\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%5E%7B2%7D&amp;plus;px&amp;plus;q%3D0\" />&nbsp;serta bilnagan p dan q adalah solusi persamaan&nbsp;<img alt=\"x^{2}+rx+s=0\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%5E%7B2%7D&amp;plus;rx&amp;plus;s%3D0\" />&nbsp;Nilai p + q + r&nbsp;+ s sama dengan.....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI3MA"},{"id":"NjU-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan <em>ADEN dan BMDF sebuah persegi denagn f merupakan titik tengah AD, Luas&nbsp;</em>segitiga CDE adalah 6 satuan luas .Luas ABC adalah</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191120141201.PNG\" style=\"height:129px; width:180px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI3MQ"},{"id":"NjU-q15","number":15,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Tersedia 10 Loket pelayanan pelanggan pada sebuah bank. Terdapat sejumlah pelanggan yang sedang berada dalam suatu baris antrian.peluang bahwa 4 orang pertama pada antrian di layaan di loket yang sama dengan salah satu dari 4 orang sebelum nya</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MzI3Mg"}]
